    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Unknown_Regions\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions\">Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>Your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attacks\" title=\"Area Attacks\">Area Attacks</a> deal more damage to one target within the area of effect.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +5</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you make a successful <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a> with a weapon with which you are proficient, select a target hit by the attack. That target takes an additional 5 points of damage from the attack, before applying the effect of the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Evasion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Evasion\">Evasion</a></b> Talent.</p>",
